description: |
  Quarantines a specified file through Cortex by moving it from its original location to a secure, local quarantine folder. Requires the file path and SHA256 hash. Logs detailed error information if the operation fails. Supports quarantining on up to 1000 Windows endpoints.
  Workflow: 1. Execute the "GetEndpointData" action with the "Cortex Core - IR" integration brand as input to get the endpoint IDs (unless provided or returned from a previous action). 2. Use this action to quarantine the files.
